## 7. EDGE CASES & ERROR HANDLING

### Critical Edge Cases Addressed

| Case | Handling Strategy |
|------|------------------|
| **Alien reaches player row** | Immediate game over (classic rule preserved) |
| **Player shield breaks mid-impact** | Shield particle burst, hit-stop applied, health reduced |
| **Power-up collision during boss fight** | Power-up absorbed, boss health unaffected |
| **Gamepad disconnected mid-game** | Fallback to keyboard input, no state reset |
| **Browser tab loses focus** | Game pauses automatically (visibility API) |
| **Particle pool exhausted** | Drop lowest-priority particles first (LRU eviction) |
| **Audio context suspended** | Resume on first user interaction (click/tap) |

### Error Boundaries

